msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:6
#, markdown-text
msgid "![Statistics](../images/screenshots/statistics.png){ .screenshot }"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:10
#, markdown-text
msgid "Registrations, completion rate, programmes sold, revenue, awards and their value."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:10
#, markdown-text
msgid "Participation and revenue per programme, registrations per age category, awards given."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:10
#, markdown-text
msgid "The **club competition** with ranked, out-of-competition and not ranked clubs (rules: [Club competition](../reference/rules.md#club-competition))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:11
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reports"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:14
#, markdown-text
msgid "Every report is available as **PDF** and **CSV** (UTF-8 with BOM, `;` separated, opens directly in Excel). Texts follow the language of the event."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:25
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Report | Content |\n|---|---|\n| Financial report | revenue per programme, awards with their value |\n| Revenue by programme and age category | participants, price and subtotal per programme and category |\n| Awards | every award given, with shooter, club, programme, value and result |\n| Club competition | ranking, out of competition and not ranked clubs |\n| Club participants | participants per club, programme and age category |\n| Special prizes | winners per programme and age category, skipped shooters with the reason (see [Programmes](programmes.md#special-prizes)) |\n| Awards to hand out | awards not yet collected, with shooter, club, programme, kind and value, plus the cash still to pay out (see [Results](results.md#handout)) |\n| Lane bookings | the clubs that asked for lanes through [online booking](online-booking.md), confirmed or still waiting, with contact, slots, lane numbers and announced shooters |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/statistics-reports.md:26
#, markdown-text
msgid "Below the reports, the ranking of every programme can be downloaded as PDF or CSV."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:1
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Users"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:4
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Users** (admins only) lists the accounts with access to the club and their role.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:6
#, markdown-text
msgid "![Users](../images/screenshots/users.png){ .screenshot }"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:11
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Invite by email**: paste one or many addresses (comma separated or one per line, up to 300) and choose the role. People without an account get a mail with a link to set their password (valid for seven days) and then log in with their email address; existing accounts are added to the club and told by mail. The list under the form says what happened to each address. Mails leave at about four per second, so a large list takes a minute."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:11
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Add user**: the older way for an account without email: an existing account is added by its user name; for a new account also enter a password (at least 10 characters)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:11
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Role**: *Admin* manages ranges, events, programmes and users; *Staff* runs the events (see [Concepts](../getting-started/concepts.md#clubs-users-and-roles))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:11
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Remove** takes away the access to this club; the account itself stays and keeps its other clubs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/users.md:12
#, markdown-text
msgid "Accounts are global: deleting an account is done by the platform operator in the [admin panel](../admin-guide/admin-panel.md). A forgotten password is reset with **Forgot your password?** on the login page if the account has a confirmed email address, otherwise by the operator."
msgstr ""
